# Shared by every rg invocation (terminal fzf pickers, vim/nvim's live-grep,
# coc.nvim search, etc. via $RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH) so ignore rules and case
# sensitivity stay consistent no matter what's driving ripgrep. Mirrors the
# --exclude list already used by fd in fcd (zsh/functions/fzf-pickers.zsh).
--smart-case
--glob=!.git/*
--glob=!node_modules/*
--glob=!build/*
